{"title":"Chalk Troll","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Troll that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/troll-heart\">Troll Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Trollbarrow</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 11</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-140\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Troll: <a href=\"#/monster/troll\">Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll\">Barrow Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/9e777a6e0f3d9c32fd07.webp\" alt=\"Chalk Troll\"></div><h3>Chalk Troll</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 28)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Troll</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>106</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>19.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>9 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}